msgid ""
"The LED will light when the returned ``pixel_count >= 2``. The returned "
"``pixel_count = (actual_pixel_count + 4) / 8``."
msgstr ""
"La LED s'allumera lorsque le pixel_count renvoyé vérifie ``pixel_count >= "
"2``. Le pixel_count renvoyé est ``pixel_count = (actual_pixel_count + 4) / "
